    "S10": {
      "caption_label": "TABLE S10",
      "caption_title": "CONVENTIONAL B004 ANNOTATION CLASSIFIERS",
      "caption": "Table S10. Conventional B004 annotation classifiers.",
      "note": "Means are the transformed and standardized cluster-level marker-expression means defined in Section 2.4. Positive fractions are the per-marker proportions of cells with positive processed expression. Classifiers used cell-level reference labels from the B004 training regions, providing richer supervision than the LLM prompts. Hyperparameters were selected in the validation regions. Metrics average the two test regions equally. Macro-F1 calculated using the original 28-label vocabulary assigns zero F1 to absent classes.",
